<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, maximum-scale=1.0, user-scalable=no">
  <title>솜하치 Hub ✨ 리뉴얼 준비 중</title>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Gowun+Dodum&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css">

  <style>
    * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
    
    body {
      font-family: 'Gowun Dodum', sans-serif;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #fff0f3 0%, #ffe3e8 100%);
      color: #2d2d3a;
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
      padding: 1.5rem;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .card {
      background: #ffffff;
      border: 2px solid #ffd6e0;
      border-radius: 24px;
      padding: 2rem 1.5rem;
      box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(255, 107, 139, 0.12);
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 380px;
    }

    .badge {
      display: inline-block;
      background: #ffe5ec;
      color: #ff0055;
      padding: 0.4rem 0.8rem;
      border-radius: 20px;
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      font-weight: bold;
      margin-bottom: 1.2rem;
    }

    .avatar-box {
      width: 90px;
      height: 90px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: #ff6b8b;
      margin: 0 auto 1.2rem;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      font-size: 2.5rem;
      color: #fff;
      box-shadow: 0 6px 16px rgba(255, 107, 139, 0.3);
    }

    h1 {
      font-size: 1.5rem;
      color: #ff3b68;
      margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    }

    p {
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      color: #6c6c80;
      line-height: 1.5;
      margin-bottom: 1.8rem;
    }

    .links {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 0.8rem;
    }

    .btn {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 0.6rem;
      padding: 0.85rem;
      border-radius: 16px;
      font-weight: bold;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      text-decoration: none;
      color: #fff;
      transition: transform 0.2s;
    }

    .btn:active { transform: scale(0.98); }
    .btn-chzzk { background: #00e583; color: #000; }
    .btn-youtube { background: #ff0000; }
    .btn-discord { background: #5865f2; }

    footer {
      margin-top: 2rem;
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      color: #999;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <div class="card">
    <div class="badge">🚧 모바일 리뉴얼 중</div>
    <div class="avatar-box">🎀</div>
    <h1>솜하치 Hub</h1>
    <p>더 예쁘고 편리한 모바일 화면으로<br>열심히 단장하고 있어요! 🛠️<br>잠시만 기다려주세요!</p>

    <div class="links">
      <a href="https://chzzk.naver.com/c0bedd64bed45287a3493479a4cc8295" target="_blank" class="btn btn-chzzk">
        <i class="fa-solid fa-play"></i> 치지직 방송 보러가기
      </a>
      <a href="https://www.youtube.com/@%EC%86%9Ce2" target="_blank" class="btn btn-youtube">
        <i class="fa-brands fa-youtube"></i> 유튜브 채널 가기
      </a>
      <a href="https://discord.gg/kYmbREBQe" target="_blank" class="btn btn-discord">
        <i class="fa-brands fa-discord"></i> 공식 디스코드 커뮤니티
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <footer>
    © 2026 Somhachi Official. All Rights Reserved.
  </footer>

</body>
</html>
